WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:03.010
- I explained that these passports,

00:00:03.010 --> 00:00:05.790
according to the agent in the booth,

00:00:05.790 --> 00:00:07.210
and I don't think he was lying to me,

00:00:07.210 --> 00:00:09.210
maybe he was, but I don't think so,

00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:12.880
he said to me when I went
to show him my barcode,

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:15.247
he said, "It's okay,
I don't need to see it

00:00:15.247 --> 00:00:17.580
"because you just pop up on the screen."

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:19.660
So there's some sort of radius

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:22.060
that they detect all the phones

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:24.160
that have a COVID passport on it.

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:26.870
And yesterday I came across
the border as well again.

00:00:26.870 --> 00:00:28.760
I did a quick little run yesterday.

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:30.260
Same thing.

00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:32.780
This time I didn't even
volunteer the passport.

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:34.210
They didn't even ask me,

00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:36.140
'cause that apparently
links to their system

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:38.780
and all my information
pops up on their screen,

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:41.700
and that's what you guys
are gonna get, as well.

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:44.450
(dramatic music)

00:00:48.860 --> 00:00:51.550
- I'm Dave Rubin, and joining
me today is the spokesman

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:55.450
for the Canadian truckers'
Freedom Convoy, a busy man.

00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:57.830
BJ Dichter, welcome to the Rubin Report.

00:00:57.830 --> 00:00:59.520
- You have no idea how busy,

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:01.490
and I started my day with a car accident,

00:01:01.490 --> 00:01:02.730
so, you know, there you go.

00:01:02.730 --> 00:01:03.563
- Oh, geez.

00:01:03.563 --> 00:01:04.480
Are you all right?

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:06.510
Does it have anything
to do with the convoy?

00:01:06.510 --> 00:01:07.600
- I'm great.

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:09.800
I'm gonna need a new
car, unfortunately, so.

00:01:10.824 --> 00:01:11.657
But what are you gonna do?

00:01:11.657 --> 00:01:12.970
Such is life

00:01:12.970 --> 00:01:13.920
- Such is life.

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:16.760
Okay, well, we'll put
that aside for a moment.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:20.620
First off, where are you right now

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:23.330
and how did you become the spokesman

00:01:23.330 --> 00:01:25.210
for this freedom caravan,

00:01:25.210 --> 00:01:28.260
or as your prime minister,
Justin Trudeau, calls it,

00:01:28.260 --> 00:01:30.860
this group of Islamophobic, transphobic,

00:01:30.860 --> 00:01:34.240
antisemitic, crazy people?

00:01:34.240 --> 00:01:35.073
- Yes.

00:01:36.070 --> 00:01:38.540
I have a good friend from Alberta.

00:01:38.540 --> 00:01:43.540
She is a Metis, a very influential
Metis native in Alberta.

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:47.730
She's from Medicine Hat,

00:01:47.730 --> 00:01:50.740
and her and some friends
came up with this idea

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:52.440
that you know, we're fed up.

00:01:52.440 --> 00:01:54.800
Our economy's crushed, we have no lives.

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:57.755
One of them, Brigitte, was
just about to lose her job,

00:01:57.755 --> 00:02:00.476
and they just decided
we gotta do something,

00:02:00.476 --> 00:02:02.210
let's do a convoy.

00:02:02.210 --> 00:02:04.100
They did one a couple years ago,

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:07.180
and it was small and unfortunately

00:02:07.180 --> 00:02:10.220
it didn't do the internal wrangling.

00:02:10.220 --> 00:02:11.610
It didn't achieve what it wanted to do,

00:02:11.610 --> 00:02:14.800
so they decided this is gonna
be the convoy of all convoys.

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:17.400
So they put the GoFundMe
up and they figured,

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:19.510
well let's get, you know, maybe
we'll get a hundred trucks,

00:02:19.510 --> 00:02:22.140
we'll get, like, I don't know, $20,000.

00:02:22.140 --> 00:02:23.600
We'll get a little bit of money

00:02:23.600 --> 00:02:26.560
and we'll go and have our voices heard.

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:29.610
And Tamara called me I think the day after

00:02:29.610 --> 00:02:31.052
they started the GoFundMe,

00:02:31.052 --> 00:02:33.137
maybe more or less day
after, maybe two days,

00:02:33.137 --> 00:02:35.110
but I think it was the day after.

00:02:35.110 --> 00:02:36.957
And she said, "Oh my God, I need help.

00:02:36.957 --> 00:02:37.900
"I need help with this."

00:02:37.900 --> 00:02:38.733
I'm like, "What's going on?"

00:02:38.733 --> 00:02:41.507
She said, "We started this
thing and it's everywhere.

00:02:41.507 --> 00:02:42.340
"It's exploding.

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:44.300
"We're already at like,"
I don't know what it was,

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:46.830
a hundred, $200,000, whatever.

00:02:46.830 --> 00:02:49.330
And she said, "Can you
come on board and help me?"

00:02:49.330 --> 00:02:51.010
'Cause she knows I produce podcasts,

00:02:51.010 --> 00:02:52.895
I do messaging and all that sort of stuff.

00:02:52.895 --> 00:02:55.140
And I said, "Yeah, sure,
it'd be my pleasure,"

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:58.163
and I also happened to
have a truck, as well.

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:00.721
So it was a perfect fit,

00:03:00.721 --> 00:03:03.730
and there we are changing the world.

00:03:03.730 --> 00:03:05.310
- So you guys put the GoFundMe up,

00:03:05.310 --> 00:03:08.190
and as we speak, is the
go GoFundMe still up?

00:03:08.190 --> 00:03:10.600
I thought I had heard something
just in the last hour or so

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:12.110
that maybe it had been taken down

00:03:12.110 --> 00:03:16.160
because of a violation of
terms of service or something?

00:03:16.160 --> 00:03:17.350
- Oh, that's the usual.

00:03:17.350 --> 00:03:20.280
Every three minutes we
get 1,000, 2,000 messages

00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:21.790
telling us it's up, it's down,

00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:24.810
it's up again, it's down
again, everybody is.

00:03:24.810 --> 00:03:27.550
People are unfortunately
a little enthusiastic

00:03:27.550 --> 00:03:29.580
and they come up with some
ideas of what's going on.

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:34.400
But right now, as far as I
know, the last I spoke to them,

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:38.730
the funds now are held for review again,

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:40.680
and I'll explain what happened.

00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:45.250
The first time, the mainstream,
sorry, the fake news media,

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:46.930
it's not mainstream,
(Dave laughs)

00:03:46.930 --> 00:03:49.370
started producing all these stories,

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:52.550
Toronto Star, CBC, Yahoo News,

00:03:52.550 --> 00:03:54.270
that our funds were frozen

00:03:54.270 --> 00:03:57.230
because of extremists and right wingers

00:03:57.230 --> 00:03:59.010
and all that sort of stuff.

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:01.570
And I said to the team, don't respond.

00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:02.960
I've used GoFundMe.

00:04:02.960 --> 00:04:05.670
I know their protocols.

00:04:05.670 --> 00:04:07.170
These are banking regulations.

00:04:07.170 --> 00:04:10.480
It always takes seven to
10 days for a new account.

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:12.580
It won't be blocked, trust me.

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:14.760
And so they're going around
building this narrative,

00:04:14.760 --> 00:04:19.120
oh, all this speculation of
why it's blocked and it is.

00:04:19.120 --> 00:04:20.900
It wasn't blocked, and then
we issued a press releaser

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:23.927
once GoFundMe said,
"Yeah, you're good to go.

00:04:23.927 --> 00:04:25.690
"You meet all the criteria."

00:04:25.690 --> 00:04:28.757
We sent a press releaser, say,
to all the fake news media.

00:04:28.757 --> 00:04:29.697
"We apologize.

00:04:29.697 --> 00:04:32.607
"We don't know why you
would release such a story.

00:04:32.607 --> 00:04:34.557
"It was never frozen for those reasons.

00:04:34.557 --> 00:04:36.397
"It's just a regular protocol,

00:04:36.397 --> 00:04:38.720
"and GoFundMe has been
great to work with."

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:39.883
- Wow.
- And that was--

00:04:39.883 --> 00:04:42.720
- All right, well, I'm glad to hear that.

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:44.580
For the record, what is the GoFundMe?

00:04:44.580 --> 00:04:47.250
Let's actually say it here
so that people can donate.

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:50.430
I know a lot of our audience
has been donating already.

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:52.710
- It's Freedom Convoy 2022.

00:04:52.710 --> 00:04:54.150
So if you go there, or you type that

00:04:54.150 --> 00:04:56.733
or Freedom Convoy Canada you'll find that.

00:04:57.620 --> 00:05:00.530
But what has happened now is now,

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:02.760
it has been frozen again.

00:05:02.760 --> 00:05:03.646
- Wow.
- Once we hit-- -

00:05:03.646 --> 00:05:06.350
- That seemed too positive a story.

00:05:06.350 --> 00:05:07.380
- It was great.

00:05:07.380 --> 00:05:08.213
It was great.

00:05:08.213 --> 00:05:09.046
Everything was going along.

00:05:09.046 --> 00:05:10.990
They were just starting to
do the first e-transfers,

00:05:10.990 --> 00:05:13.110
and we did get some money
transferred or whatever,

00:05:13.110 --> 00:05:17.170
and then yesterday, last night,
boom, message on the screen,

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:20.110
10 point one million dollars, whatever,

00:05:20.110 --> 00:05:22.750
now it's being held for review.

00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:23.990
We think what happened,

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:27.440
and this tends to happen a lot
for people who use GoFundMe,

00:05:27.440 --> 00:05:31.040
it tends to happen a lot
from the fake news media.

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:32.340
What they'll do is they'll get,

00:05:32.340 --> 00:05:34.270
or the leftist politicians,

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:38.100
they'll get an army of
people brigading your account

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:40.690
and just, you know, overload the system,

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:42.580
and then the algorithm triggers,

00:05:42.580 --> 00:05:45.640
and then boom, it's being sent for review.

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:46.550
Luckily now,

00:05:46.550 --> 00:05:49.343
because there's been so much
international attention,

00:05:50.290 --> 00:05:53.260
we have a team of lawyers
and a couple of accountants

00:05:53.260 --> 00:05:54.460
that have flown in.

00:05:54.460 --> 00:05:56.440
They're on site now in Ottawa.

00:05:56.440 --> 00:05:57.880
They came yesterday

00:05:57.880 --> 00:05:59.340
and they're now starting the dialogue

00:05:59.340 --> 00:06:01.290
working with GoFundMe and
all that sort of stuff.

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:06.290
So I imagine GoFundMe wants
to avoid the PR disaster

00:06:06.370 --> 00:06:08.760
of all PR disasters
and will be good to go.

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:10.000
That's what I think.

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:10.833
- Right, all right.

00:06:10.833 --> 00:06:12.080
So let's cross our fingers on that.

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:14.840
So in the simplest, in the simplest terms,

00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:16.480
now that we've all seen the videos,

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:17.730
I'm covering it every day,

00:06:17.730 --> 00:06:20.150
it's starting even to
bubble up a little bit

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:23.670
in mainstream media, although
as you say, fake news media,

00:06:23.670 --> 00:06:26.340
it's tough to get these guys
to have to pay attention

00:06:26.340 --> 00:06:30.560
to the right things, what
is it that you guys want?

00:06:30.560 --> 00:06:33.480
What is the end game for the truckers

00:06:33.480 --> 00:06:34.910
and their supporters?

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:35.743
- Simple

00:06:35.743 --> 00:06:39.200
End the mandates and the passports.

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:41.190
Now, the reason there's those two things,

00:06:41.190 --> 00:06:43.479
the mandates, obviously,
that's the vaccine mandates.

00:06:43.479 --> 00:06:45.770
There's certain people who
want it, don't want it.

00:06:45.770 --> 00:06:47.260
Freedom of choice.

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:48.470
I'm vaccinated.

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:50.963
Some of people are, some of them aren't,

00:06:51.950 --> 00:06:53.090
but it's their choice.

00:06:53.090 --> 00:06:55.260
It's not the government's choice to,

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:57.500
you know, it's your body, our choice.

00:06:57.500 --> 00:06:59.520
No, that's not how it works here, right?

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:00.353
- [Dave] Apparently.

00:07:00.353 --> 00:07:03.040
- The other thing is, the passports,

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:05.330
as I think you saw when I was on "Tucker",

00:07:05.330 --> 00:07:08.230
I explained that these passports,

00:07:08.230 --> 00:07:11.010
according to the agent in the booth,

00:07:11.010 --> 00:07:12.450
and I don't think he was lying to me,

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:14.440
maybe he was, but I don't think so,

00:07:14.440 --> 00:07:18.110
he said to me when I went
to show him my barcode,

00:07:18.110 --> 00:07:20.477
he said, "It's okay,
I don't need to see it

00:07:20.477 --> 00:07:22.810
"because you just pop up on the screen,"

00:07:22.810 --> 00:07:24.880
so there's some sort of radius

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:27.280
that they detect all the phones

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:29.380
that have a COVID passport on it.

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:32.090
And yesterday I came across
the border as well again.

00:07:32.090 --> 00:07:33.980
I did a quick little run yesterday.

00:07:33.980 --> 00:07:35.480
Same thing.

00:07:35.480 --> 00:07:37.970
This time I didn't even
volunteer the passport.

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:39.430
They didn't even ask me,

00:07:39.430 --> 00:07:41.370
'cause that apparently
links to their system

00:07:41.370 --> 00:07:44.010
and all my information
pops up on their screen,

00:07:44.010 --> 00:07:47.150
and that's what you guys
are gonna get, as well.

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:49.610
- I mean, it's truly, it's
an episode of "Black Mirror"

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:53.020
with a little bit of "Minority
Reports" and "Total Recall",

00:07:53.020 --> 00:07:54.143
a little bit of "The Matrix".

00:07:54.143 --> 00:07:55.540
It's all happening right now.

00:07:55.540 --> 00:07:59.470
Okay, so the reaction to you guys

00:07:59.470 --> 00:08:02.470
from say the people that watch this show

00:08:02.470 --> 00:08:03.570
has been pretty positive.

00:08:03.570 --> 00:08:05.110
The reaction from Tucker's audience

00:08:05.110 --> 00:08:07.350
has been pretty positive,
worldwide, pretty positive.

00:08:07.350 --> 00:08:09.930
So I guess I got two on
that, which is number one,

00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:11.790
how does it feel to be in
the thick of something?

00:08:11.790 --> 00:08:14.000
I mean, Canadians are not
used to being in the thick

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:17.070
of, like, a true cultural
political moment.

00:08:17.070 --> 00:08:18.490
I mean, that's number one.

00:08:18.490 --> 00:08:21.810
And then number two, do you think

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:23.950
that there's gonna be real
change because of this?

00:08:23.950 --> 00:08:25.910
I mean, it seems in the last day,

00:08:25.910 --> 00:08:27.920
even though Trudeau's hiding, you know

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:29.910
the premier of Alberta kind of was like,

00:08:29.910 --> 00:08:32.170
oh maybe we should give
into some of these demands.

00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:34.450
He was sort of like, oh,
I kind of wanted to do it,

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:36.300
but now maybe they'll actually do it.

00:08:38.070 --> 00:08:38.920
- How does it feel?

00:08:38.920 --> 00:08:40.110
It's quite amazing.

00:08:40.110 --> 00:08:41.995
I've told this story a
couple of times to people

00:08:41.995 --> 00:08:44.690
that I went behind the
parliament buildings

00:08:44.690 --> 00:08:45.940
when I first arrived here.

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:47.890
There's a park behind
the parliament buildings,

00:08:47.890 --> 00:08:50.270
and there's a bridge that
crosses over into Quebec,

00:08:50.270 --> 00:08:52.710
and I'm sure Viva Frei can expand on this.

00:08:52.710 --> 00:08:55.330
There were, it was an army.

00:08:55.330 --> 00:08:56.163
I don't wanna use that word.

00:08:56.163 --> 00:08:57.465
That means we're violent.
- No.

00:08:57.465 --> 00:08:58.640
(laughs)
Right?

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:00.400
There was--
- Quote.

00:09:00.400 --> 00:09:04.060
- There was thousands, thousands of people

00:09:04.060 --> 00:09:06.490
crossing the bridge into Ontario

00:09:06.490 --> 00:09:10.440
with their Quebec flags
and their Canadian flags,

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:13.760
remember, separatism has always
been a problem in Canada,

00:09:13.760 --> 00:09:15.490
together and going to meet

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:18.930
their Albertan and prairie truck drivers

00:09:18.930 --> 00:09:21.360
and hanging out together,
giving each other hugs.

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:23.560
And, you know, some guys
didn't speak English,

00:09:23.560 --> 00:09:24.850
some guys didn't speak French,

00:09:24.850 --> 00:09:27.960
but they're trying to figure
out how to talk to each other,

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:30.480
showing each other, you
know, look, this is truck,

00:09:30.480 --> 00:09:31.710
this is horn, beep beep.

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:34.100
And, you know, like, it was wonderful.

00:09:34.100 --> 00:09:36.740
For the first time in
this country's history,

00:09:36.740 --> 00:09:39.370
you got this sense of unity.

00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:41.110
And one, you know, Canadians

00:09:41.110 --> 00:09:42.060
are not gonna like me saying this,

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:44.280
but one inferiority complex

00:09:44.280 --> 00:09:49.280
that we tend to have in Canada
is you do have that unity

00:09:50.540 --> 00:09:54.392
of what it is to be an American, right?

00:09:54.392 --> 00:09:58.030
And for the first time
I'm seeing that in Canada.

00:09:58.030 --> 00:09:58.863
- [Dave] Wow.

00:09:58.863 --> 00:09:59.696
- It's absolutely amazing,

00:09:59.696 --> 00:10:01.553
so to be in the middle of
that, it's awe-inspiring.

00:10:01.553 --> 00:10:04.050
- Are you shocked how ridiculous

00:10:04.050 --> 00:10:06.200
the over-the-top attacks have been?

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:08.025
I mean that tweet by Trudeau,

00:10:08.025 --> 00:10:11.910
it's like he's got nothing
left, nothing left.

00:10:11.910 --> 00:10:14.540
And there was the other tweet from him,

00:10:14.540 --> 00:10:16.910
you know, a year ago,
truckers are all heroes,

00:10:16.910 --> 00:10:19.193
and now truckers are all the bad guys.

00:10:20.280 --> 00:10:21.710
- I'm not surprised in the least.

00:10:21.710 --> 00:10:24.900
I actually, before he did
that press conference,

00:10:24.900 --> 00:10:27.960
I put on my Twitter, prediction,

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:31.940
Prime Minister Diversity
Blackface is gonna come out

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:35.960
and call us all racist and
bigots and whatever phobes,

00:10:35.960 --> 00:10:37.840
and he's gonna publicly shame us.

00:10:37.840 --> 00:10:38.770
Why?

00:10:38.770 --> 00:10:41.100
Because extremists always double down.

00:10:41.100 --> 00:10:43.703
They only have one
strategy, and that's it.

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:47.620
- Where do you see this going
over the next couple days?

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:51.280
I mean, do you think that
they're gonna really turn around

00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:52.113
some of this stuff?

00:10:52.113 --> 00:10:53.680
Do you think that this gets protracted?

00:10:53.680 --> 00:10:55.650
Are you afraid that maybe
they give you an inch?

00:10:55.650 --> 00:10:57.120
I mean, this has been
the thing that I've seen

00:10:57.120 --> 00:10:57.953
in the last couple days,

00:10:57.953 --> 00:11:00.250
where it's like, all right,
the premier of Alberta says,

00:11:00.250 --> 00:11:02.440
okay we'll move on some of this stuff.

00:11:02.440 --> 00:11:03.860
And then you guys dissipate,

00:11:03.860 --> 00:11:05.630
you go back throughout the country,

00:11:05.630 --> 00:11:07.440
and then they just ramp
it up again a week later,

00:11:07.440 --> 00:11:09.870
knowing that, you know,
you can do this once,

00:11:09.870 --> 00:11:12.680
but you probably can't do
it at this level twice.

00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:13.600
- Yeah, that's what they tried

00:11:13.600 --> 00:11:15.460
with their convoy a couple of years ago,

00:11:15.460 --> 00:11:18.630
and they were successful in
basically divide and conquer,

00:11:18.630 --> 00:11:21.900
and the politicians got
one faction of their convoy

00:11:21.900 --> 00:11:24.920
fighting with another faction,
and then it just fell apart.

00:11:24.920 --> 00:11:29.380
And a lot of people from
out west learned that lesson

00:11:29.380 --> 00:11:31.960
that we're not gonna
let this happen again.

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:34.940
Personally, I honestly don't see this

00:11:34.940 --> 00:11:36.610
going on too much longer.

00:11:36.610 --> 00:11:38.393
That's just my, I might be wrong.

00:11:39.951 --> 00:11:41.850
The morale on the ground is great.

00:11:41.850 --> 00:11:45.480
There's people dancing,
meeting, people falling in love.

00:11:45.480 --> 00:11:48.190
Like, it's like a hippie
party, like we become hippies.

00:11:48.190 --> 00:11:49.990
- I love it.
- We're playing the videos,

00:11:49.990 --> 00:11:51.480
man, with all the music

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:54.060
and they're cleaning up after
themselves and shoveling snow.

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:55.230
It's awesome.

00:11:55.230 --> 00:11:59.070
- And so we've had some
communications with the police

00:11:59.070 --> 00:12:02.362
because we do have a command
center with ex-military

00:12:02.362 --> 00:12:05.040
and a couple of ex-police officers there

00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:06.940
ensuring that we have safety protocols,

00:12:06.940 --> 00:12:08.870
emergency vehicles have paths

00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:10.840
that they can go around things.

00:12:10.840 --> 00:12:12.000
Like it's really,

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:13.880
it was really disorganized
when we got here,

00:12:13.880 --> 00:12:15.250
'cause we were overwhelmed,

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:18.380
but what the police have indicated to us,

00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:21.140
they were monitoring us for several days

00:12:21.140 --> 00:12:24.377
and they said, all right,
"You guys have been peaceful.

00:12:24.377 --> 00:12:25.567
"You've been great.

00:12:25.567 --> 00:12:29.057
"We know all that stuff in
the media are complete lies.

00:12:29.057 --> 00:12:30.607
"Keep it up.

00:12:30.607 --> 00:12:32.687
"We are not going to act.

00:12:32.687 --> 00:12:35.287
"This is now a political issue,

00:12:35.287 --> 00:12:37.287
"and the government will deal with you."

00:12:38.220 --> 00:12:40.430
The Conservative leader
was forced to resign,

00:12:40.430 --> 00:12:43.771
which I had told him a while
ago, I'll get you, and we did.

00:12:43.771 --> 00:12:45.050
(Dave laughs)

00:12:45.050 --> 00:12:47.810
It was chasing Trudeau off a
cliff, and well, there you go.

00:12:47.810 --> 00:12:50.610
So I don't see this going on for too,

00:12:50.610 --> 00:12:52.450
at some point Trudeau's gotta realize

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:57.450
all these countries in Europe
have abandoned the mandates.

00:12:57.800 --> 00:13:00.110
It's the easiest win in the world for him

00:13:00.110 --> 00:13:00.943
to say, you know what?

00:13:00.943 --> 00:13:04.600
I, the people, I disagree
with them, but you know what?

00:13:04.600 --> 00:13:06.010
The science has changed.

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:10.160
We're gonna follow the
European Union and the UK

00:13:10.160 --> 00:13:14.040
and we're gonna remove
all the restrictions.

00:13:14.040 --> 00:13:15.100
Will he, I don't know.

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:17.620
- Right, 'cause it's hard
once you've called everybody

00:13:17.620 --> 00:13:19.030
a bunch of racist, bigot--
- That's right.

00:13:19.030 --> 00:13:20.620
- Homophobes to be like, ah, you know,

00:13:20.620 --> 00:13:22.710
but they did have a good point.

00:13:22.710 --> 00:13:24.620
You mentioned that the Conservative leader

00:13:24.620 --> 00:13:26.030
just got voted out.

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:28.870
So obviously I'm not an
expert in Canadian politics,

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:30.500
but I think I have a decent handle.

00:13:30.500 --> 00:13:32.930
And in essence, you guys sort of have

00:13:32.930 --> 00:13:34.700
two liberal parties actually.

00:13:34.700 --> 00:13:37.070
One of them's just kinda
called the Conservative Party.

00:13:37.070 --> 00:13:39.610
They're not very conservative in any way,

00:13:39.610 --> 00:13:41.710
but then you have the People's Party,

00:13:41.710 --> 00:13:43.380
which Maxime Bernier, who I've had on,

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:45.220
who's been very involved in all of this.

00:13:45.220 --> 00:13:47.000
is the more libertarian party.

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:49.380
Do you sense that they could
gain a lot out of this?

00:13:49.380 --> 00:13:50.300
And the Conservative

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:52.550
and Liberal party are just
gonna morph into one thing?

00:13:52.550 --> 00:13:56.440
Like, do you see a real
reshaping of politics in Canada,

00:13:56.440 --> 00:13:59.595
because it's like
freedom or not, pick one?

00:13:59.595 --> 00:14:03.130
- I wish that were the case,
but no, and I'll tell you why.

00:14:03.130 --> 00:14:04.310
And I know Max personally.

00:14:04.310 --> 00:14:07.360
I spoke at his first conference.

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:12.360
The Conservative Party after
Stephen Harper lost decided,

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:14.410
and I met some of those people

00:14:14.410 --> 00:14:16.417
and I was in some of
meetings, and they said,

00:14:16.417 --> 00:14:19.350
"Well, we're gonna go more center."

00:14:19.350 --> 00:14:21.017
And I said, "You wanna go center?

00:14:21.017 --> 00:14:21.850
"That's okay."

00:14:21.850 --> 00:14:22.683
Like on social issues.

00:14:22.683 --> 00:14:24.610
Like, I'm very libertarian socially.

00:14:24.610 --> 00:14:25.443
That's great.

00:14:25.443 --> 00:14:28.440
That's a good idea, but don't
follow those guys off a cliff.

00:14:28.440 --> 00:14:29.650
Well, they did.

00:14:29.650 --> 00:14:32.720
So now they have to rediscover their roots

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:34.340
and become actual conservatives.

00:14:34.340 --> 00:14:39.340
But there's 45 MPs that
voted to keep Erin O'Toole,

00:14:40.590 --> 00:14:42.620
the bald version of Justin Trudeau,

00:14:42.620 --> 00:14:46.400
so that's gonna be a problem
internally in the party.

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:48.430
Maxime, but the problem

00:14:48.430 --> 00:14:51.870
with the PPC is there's no ground game.

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:54.280
The last two elections I asked him

00:14:54.280 --> 00:14:56.070
and I'd asked his other candidates,

00:14:56.070 --> 00:15:00.560
I said, "What's your GOTV
strategy?", your get out the vote.

00:15:00.560 --> 00:15:01.393
And Max always said,

00:15:01.393 --> 00:15:02.307
"Oh, we're gonna do it at the conference.

00:15:02.307 --> 00:15:03.140
"We're gonna do it here."

00:15:03.140 --> 00:15:06.130
And I asked their candidates,
they have no idea.

00:15:06.130 --> 00:15:08.223
So if they're gonna be serious about it,

00:15:09.170 --> 00:15:11.960
I think they gotta dial back
the grand standing a little bit

00:15:11.960 --> 00:15:14.740
and actually do community
engagement, and they do nothing.

00:15:14.740 --> 00:15:16.480
I mean, that's how politics works, right?

00:15:16.480 --> 00:15:18.380
You gotta get riding by riding,

00:15:18.380 --> 00:15:19.640
and they're doing none of it.

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:20.950
So I dunno.

00:15:20.950 --> 00:15:22.630
I think the strategy

00:15:22.630 --> 00:15:25.360
that they're using right
now is just gonna lead

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:29.540
to back to the old liberal
versus conservative.

00:15:29.540 --> 00:15:32.040
But the question is, will
the Conservative Party

00:15:32.040 --> 00:15:34.590
become more center-right?

00:15:34.590 --> 00:15:35.423
Will they?

00:15:35.423 --> 00:15:37.562
With Candice at the helm, yes,

00:15:37.562 --> 00:15:41.413
but she's an interim leader,
and it's frustrating.

00:15:41.413 --> 00:15:42.740
The reason I got away

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:44.730
from a lot of this stuff
is because you say to them,

00:15:44.730 --> 00:15:47.450
okay, well, take her,
use her an intern leader,

00:15:47.450 --> 00:15:50.260
go into an election as soon as possible,

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:55.060
and then if she wins,
then keep her as leader.

00:15:55.060 --> 00:15:56.940
But everybody turns into a bureaucrat.

00:15:56.940 --> 00:15:59.760
Well, you know, the rules and
the policy guide is she can't.

00:15:59.760 --> 00:16:02.840
Like, screw the rules,
amend, use your head,

00:16:02.840 --> 00:16:05.540
use your moral will and moral skill.

00:16:05.540 --> 00:16:06.950
But they have that inability,

00:16:06.950 --> 00:16:09.500
and that's the biggest thing
that destroys that party

00:16:09.500 --> 00:16:11.030
in all the years that I've known it.

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:12.049
- To Candice Bergen's credit,

00:16:12.049 --> 00:16:14.710
at least she called him
out on the black face

00:16:14.710 --> 00:16:15.543
the other day--
- She's great.

00:16:15.543 --> 00:16:16.570
- In Parliament, so that was pretty good.

00:16:16.570 --> 00:16:19.100
All right, here's the bumper clip.

00:16:19.100 --> 00:16:22.130
We're gonna clip this thing
and put it up on social media.

00:16:22.130 --> 00:16:23.320
If you had a message--
- No pressure.

00:16:23.320 --> 00:16:27.300
- Right now, maybe to Justin
Trudeau and to the world,

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:29.700
it can be two messages,
it can be one message.

00:16:29.700 --> 00:16:31.310
Give something that everybody can see

00:16:31.310 --> 00:16:35.430
and hear and truly under
what you guys are all about.

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:37.870
- If you're anywhere near Ottawa,

00:16:37.870 --> 00:16:40.490
come down to Trudeau's Truckstop

00:16:40.490 --> 00:16:43.220
right in front of his
office and his Parliament.

00:16:43.220 --> 00:16:46.150
It is all peace and love.

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:48.260
We are gonna solve this together.

00:16:48.260 --> 00:16:49.340
It's all unity.

00:16:49.340 --> 00:16:50.940
It's a great vibe.

00:16:50.940 --> 00:16:52.430
Yes, people are upset.

00:16:52.430 --> 00:16:55.360
They want change, and
change is on the horizon

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:57.690
but we're gonna do that
when we stick together

00:16:57.690 --> 00:17:00.510
and we be unified and
we don't take the bait

00:17:00.510 --> 00:17:02.740
from the leftist activists,

00:17:02.740 --> 00:17:04.590
and we got all the time in the world.

00:17:04.590 --> 00:17:05.540
We're gonna do it.

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:09.010
And I think once we do, once
we're successful with it,

00:17:09.010 --> 00:17:13.090
you're gonna see all the
provinces follow suit.

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:16.140
And that might, I'm hoping,
will have a ripple effect

00:17:16.140 --> 00:17:17.910
in the United States

00:17:17.910 --> 00:17:20.040
given the amount of support we're getting

00:17:20.040 --> 00:17:23.460
from our American brethren
in the trucking industry.

00:17:23.460 --> 00:17:28.460
And there's a whole convoy of
American trucks at the border.

00:17:28.730 --> 00:17:31.680
I think, it's not Montana,
it's another border.

00:17:31.680 --> 00:17:34.860
American trucks draped in Canadian flags.

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:36.190
Would you ever have dreamed

00:17:36.190 --> 00:17:38.050
of thinking of that ever happening?

00:17:38.050 --> 00:17:41.510
That's the type of unity that
is gonna come out of this,

00:17:41.510 --> 00:17:44.600
and we're right on the
crusp of a new golden age,

00:17:44.600 --> 00:17:46.750
where we all start to
listen to each other.

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:49.540
- How about that for a positive story

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:50.500
and a grand narrative?

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:52.090
BJ, I wish you guys the best of luck.

00:17:52.090 --> 00:17:54.930
Anything I can do for help,
you know where to get me,

00:17:54.930 --> 00:17:58.280
and now get out there and
change the world, man.

00:17:58.280 --> 00:17:59.113
Thanks.

00:17:59.113 --> 00:17:59.946
- All right, brother.

00:17:59.946 --> 00:18:01.170
We'll talk to you soon, thanks again.

